    "body": "The current code has three rotate rings and an undoable turn command. Move mode hides the rings. Rotate mode hides the move arrows.\n\nPR #2662 adds typed values and Shift snapping. This branch starts from that PR. The change will show both handle sets in Move mode.\n\nThe existing turn command marks the toolpath stale. The MCP move_model tool already accepts a pivot.\n",
